# Rancher Manager MCP

Go MCP server for Rancher Manager API (stdio + HTTP).

Cursor uses `.cursor/rules/` (this file + org common). Legacy `.cursorrules` / Copilot instructions remain for other tools.

## Key paths

- `cmd/main.go` — entry point
- `internal/server/` — tool registration and Rancher client
- `internal/mcp/` — MCP protocol

## Conventions

- Tokens via env / `.env.example` only; never commit secrets
- Rancher API: `/apis/management.cattle.io/v3/` with Bearer auth
